24:45.360 --> 24:49.820
The traditional equilibrium restoration models have a severe fundamental limitation.

24:50.740 --> 24:57.920
Because ecosystems accumulate this non-commutative directional history, there is often no meaningful return to a prior state.

24:58.220 --> 25:00.720
