25:00.720 --> 25:08.480
The goal of conservation should not be to try and artificially reconstruct a past that no longer geometrically fits the present.

25:09.000 --> 25:18.000
If we accept that systems must constantly move forward into new geometries to survive, we have to look at what happens when human activity forces those systems into dead ends.

25:18.580 --> 25:22.680
Because right now, human optimization is the ultimate force of change on the planet.

