Meaning the energy from the sun was captured by algae floating in the open, deep water, which fed small fish, which fed larger predatory fish in the open water.

26:57.480 --> 27:02.960
But the zebra mussels filtered the water so aggressively that they literally made it crystal clear.

27:03.120 --> 27:03.480
Wow.

