27:06.400 --> 27:12.420
This shifted the entire energy vector of the lake from the open water down to the benthic zone, which is the lake bed.

27:12.420 --> 27:18.740
So they physically pulled the calories out of the open water and basically stapled them to the floor of the lake.

27:19.080 --> 27:19.500
Precisely.

27:19.860 --> 27:22.480
They restructured the trophic accessibility relations.

27:23.120 --> 27:29.920
Deep water fish starved because the energy they relied on was now locked up on the lake bottom, accessible only to different species.

